# hotkeys.js/hotkeys.json are tracked (not gitignored) deliberately, unlike lib/app-hotkeys.ahk
# on the Windows side — for the meantime, a `git pull` here is meant to bring your real Linux
# hotkey config along with it, not just the sanitized hotkeys.template.js examples. Revisit if
# that ever needs to change (e.g. a runCommand argv gains a real absolute path, or a urlPatterns
# entry gets more personal than "mail.google.com").